userData.info:
Settings, commands, AI profiles, chats, editor history and installed plugins are kept here. Put the folder into a synced one (Syncthing, Nextcloud, Dropbox, OneDrive) to use them on several computers. Hotkeys, window insertion, keys, the interface scale, FastNote folders and logs stay on each device.

The editor history and chats may hold private text and go to the cloud of the sync service you use. Commands and plugins of the folder run on every computer it is connected to.

Default location: {defaultPath}
